// Application icon. Resource ID 1 is the one gpui-pre-windows 0.3.10 passes to LoadImageW
// (platform.rs load_icon: PCWSTR(1 as _), IMAGE_ICON) for the window class icon, so the
// title-bar corner, taskbar and Alt+Tab pick this up; Explorer shows the lowest-ID icon group.
1 ICON "brand/zeeterm.ico"
